# Exact integer comparisons and interoperable integer/decimal values.
assert 9007199254740993 is greater than 9007199254740992.
assert 9223372036854775807 is not equal to 9223372036854775806.
assert 1 is not equal to 1.0.
assert 9007199254740993 is not equal to 9007199254740992.0.
assert 1.0 is not one of (a list of 1, 2, 3).
let values be a list of 1, 1.0, 2, 2.0.
assert length of (distinct of values) is equal to 4.
print "Exact numeric comparisons OK".
